---
import '../styles/global.css';
import SiteNav from '../components/SiteNav.astro';
// ResonantOS Marketing Site - Immersive Design
---

<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<meta charset="utf-8" />
		<link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
		<link rel="apple-touch-icon" sizes="192x192" href="/favicon-192.png" />
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
		<meta name="generator" content={Astro.generator} />
		
		<!-- SEO Meta Tags -->
		<title>ResonantOS — Where a Human and a Trusted AI Meet</title>
		<meta name="description" content="ResonantOS is a browser-first operating layer for working with AI in resonance: one trusted interface (Augmentor) helps you think, remember, decide, and coordinate specialist agents without losing context, sovereignty, or craft." />

		<!-- Open Graph -->
		<meta property="og:title" content="ResonantOS — Where a Human and a Trusted AI Meet" />
		<meta property="og:description" content="A browser-first operating layer for the era of agentic AI: one trusted interface, one strategist (Augmentor), many specialists, compounding memory, and a community that stewards the whole." />
		<meta property="og:type" content="website" />
		<meta property="og:url" content="https://resonantos.com" />
		
		<!-- Twitter Card -->
		<meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image" />
		<meta name="twitter:title" content="ResonantOS — Where a Human and a Trusted AI Meet" />
		<meta name="twitter:description" content="A browser-first operating layer for the era of agentic AI: one trusted interface, one strategist (Augmentor), many specialists, compounding memory, and a community that stewards the whole." />
		
		<!-- Fonts: DM Sans for brand consistency -->
		<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
		<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
		<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@300;400;500;600;700&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
	</head>
	
	<body class="bg-zinc-950 text-zinc-100 antialiased overflow-x-hidden">
		<!-- Animated Background -->
		<div id="background-container" class="fixed inset-0 z-0 overflow-hidden">
			<div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-zinc-950 via-zinc-900 to-zinc-950"></div>
			
			<!-- Animated gradient orbs -->
			<div class="gradient-orb gradient-orb-1"></div>
			<div class="gradient-orb gradient-orb-2"></div>
			<div class="gradient-orb gradient-orb-3"></div>
			<div class="gradient-orb gradient-orb-4"></div>
			
			<!-- Noise overlay -->
			<div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-[0.03]" style="background-image: url('data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg viewBox=%220 0 256 256%22 xmlns=%22http://www.w3.org/2000/svg%22%3E%3Cfilter id=%22noise%22%3E%3CfeTurbulence type=%22fractalNoise%22 baseFrequency=%220.9%22 numOctaves=%224%22 stitchTiles=%22stitch%22/%3E%3C/filter%3E%3Crect width=%22100%25%22 height=%22100%25%22 filter=%22url(%23noise)%22/%3E%3C/svg%3E');"></div>
		</div>

		<!-- Fixed Viewport Blur Zones -->
		<div id="blur-zone-top" class="blur-zone blur-zone-top"></div>
		<div id="blur-zone-bottom" class="blur-zone blur-zone-bottom"></div>

		<!-- Navigation -->
		<SiteNav />

		<!-- Giant Hero Logo -->
		<section id="hero-section" class="h-screen relative flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden">
			<div id="hero-logo" class="text-center select-none w-full px-4" style="filter: blur(0.5px);">
				<h1 class="hero-text leading-none tracking-tight">
					<span class="font-light text-white">Resonant</span><span class="font-bold text-emerald-400">OS</span>
				</h1>
				<p class="tagline-text text-zinc-400 mt-6 font-light" style="filter: blur(0px);">
					Where a human and a trusted AI meet to think, work, and remember together
				</p>
			</div>
			
			<!-- Scroll indicator -->
			<div class="absolute bottom-8 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 animate-bounce">
				<svg class="w-6 h-6 text-zinc-500" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
					<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 14l-7 7m0 0l-7-7m7 7V3"></path>
				</svg>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- Scroll Content Container -->
		<div id="scroll-content" class="relative z-20">

		<!-- What is ResonantOS -->
		<section id="what-is" class="content-section py-12 scroll-mt-[25vh]">
			<div class="glass-banner text-left">
				<div class="banner-content prose-content">
					<h2 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold mb-8 tracking-tight">Why <span class="gradient-text">ResonantOS</span>?</h2>
					<div class="space-y-6 text-lg text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed">
						<p>
							The modern computer has lost its resonance. Tasks, contexts, and tools have been scattered across so many surfaces that the work has become hard to feel, hard to follow, and hard to trust.
						</p>
						<p>
							AI was supposed to reduce the friction. Too often, it adds another window to manage.
						</p>
						<p class="text-xl font-semibold gradient-text mt-8">
							ResonantOS gives you one resonant interface between you, your work, and a trusted AI.
						</p>
						<p>
							That AI is called <strong class="color-secondary">Augmentor</strong>. It is not a worker bot, and it is not a chat window. It is a high-level strategist — the partner that understands your context, helps you think, holds your memory, and coordinates specialist add-ons (Hermes, OpenCode, and others) when execution is needed. The discipline behind this relationship is called <strong class="color-secondary">Augmentatism</strong>: the practice of preserving human sovereignty by co-evolving with AI through conscious, craft-centered augmentation — gardener, not machinist.
						</p>
						<ul class="space-y-3 text-zinc-300">
							<li>• <strong class="color-secondary">Less friction:</strong> one place to ask, plan, search, and act.</li>
							<li>• <strong class="color-secondary">Less lost context:</strong> memory compounds instead of resetting every session.</li>
							<li>• <strong class="color-secondary">Less tool chaos:</strong> Augmentor coordinates the specialists, so you do not have to manage every agent yourself.</li>
							<li>• <strong class="color-secondary">A trust model that fits you:</strong> Augmentor acts inside boundaries you set, enforced by smart contracts — so you stay in charge of how much supervision you actually need, not in charge of every click.</li>
						</ul>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- The ResonantOS Platform -->
		<section id="economy" class="content-section py-12 scroll-mt-[25vh]">
			<div class="glass-banner text-left">
				<div class="banner-content prose-content">
					<h2 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold mb-8 tracking-tight">What It <span class="gradient-text">Changes</span></h2>
					<div class="space-y-6 text-lg text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed">
						<p>
							The goal is not to add another thing to manage. The goal is to put the resonance back into your computer — the sense that the tools, the memory, and the AI are all working with you, not against you.
						</p>

						<div class="component-card my-8">
							<h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-4 text-zinc-100">What the practice of working with Augmentor looks like:</h3>
							<ul class="space-y-4 text-zinc-300">
								<li class="flex items-start">
									<span class="color-primary mr-3 mt-1">→</span>
									<span><strong class="color-secondary">You open ResonantOS.</strong> Instead of a blank browser, you arrive inside a relationship with Augmentor — the strategist that already knows your projects, your memory, and your past decisions.</span>
								</li>
								<li class="flex items-start">
									<span class="color-primary mr-3 mt-1">→</span>
									<span><strong class="color-secondary">You explain what you want.</strong> Augmentor helps you think it through: clarifying the question, planning the work, searching, comparing, deciding. Strategy stays with you; the AI helps carry it.</span>
								</li>
								<li class="flex items-start">
									<span class="color-primary mr-3 mt-1">→</span>
									<span><strong class="color-secondary">The AI can use the browser.</strong> When action helps, Augmentor reads pages, navigates, clicks, types — and shows you, step by step, what it is doing and why.</span>
								</li>
								<li class="flex items-start">
									<span class="color-primary mr-3 mt-1">→</span>
									<span><strong class="color-secondary">Specialists do specialist work.</strong> Add-ons like Hermes (agentic work) and OpenCode (coding) handle execution through Augmentor — many hands, one strategist, no lost context.</span>
								</li>
								<li class="flex items-start">
									<span class="color-primary mr-3 mt-1">→</span>
									<span><strong class="color-secondary">The system remembers.</strong> Useful sources, decisions, and notes can enter the Living Archive, so the next session can pick up where the last one left off.</span>
								</li>
							</ul>
						</div>

						<p>
							ResonantOS is also the portal for <strong class="color-secondary">ResonantDAO</strong> — the stewardship layer that holds the values, the licence, and the community around the system. The app is the work. The DAO is the promise that the work will stay aligned with the people who use it.
						</p>

						<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4 mt-8">
							<div class="emergent-card text-center">
								<div class="mb-3 flex justify-center">
									<svg class="w-8 h-8 text-emerald-400" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
										<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M21 21l-6-6m2-5a7 7 0 11-14 0 7 7 0 0114 0z"/>
									</svg>
								</div>
								<h4 class="font-semibold color-primary mb-2">One interface</h4>
								<p class="text-sm text-zinc-400">One trusted AI surface where strategy, memory, and action meet — instead of a constellation of disconnected assistants.</p>
							</div>
							<div class="emergent-card text-center">
								<div class="mb-3 flex justify-center">
									<svg class="w-8 h-8 text-emerald-400" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
										<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M12 8c-1.657 0-3 .895-3 2s1.343 2 3 2 3 .895 3 2-1.343 2-3 2m0-8c1.11 0 2.08.402 2.599 1M12 8V7m0 1v8m0 0v1m0-1c-1.11 0-2.08-.402-2.599-1M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/>
									</svg>
								</div>
								<h4 class="font-semibold color-primary mb-2">Many specialists</h4>
								<p class="text-sm text-zinc-400">Hermes, OpenCode, memory systems, browser tools, and future agents can plug in — and speak through Augmentor, not around you.</p>
							</div>
							<div class="emergent-card text-center">
								<div class="mb-3 flex justify-center">
									<svg class="w-8 h-8 text-emerald-400" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
										<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M8 14v3m4-3v3m4-3v3M3 21h18M3 10h18M3 7l9-4 9 4M4 10h16v11H4V10z"/>
									</svg>
								</div>
								<h4 class="font-semibold color-primary mb-2">Shared stewardship</h4>
								<p class="text-sm text-zinc-400">ResonantDAO gives the ecosystem a path toward contribution and co-ownership that does not depend on buying influence.</p>
							</div>
						</div>

						<p class="mt-8 text-zinc-400 italic">
						The app comes first because it must be useful in real hands. The DAO matters because the ecosystem should be shaped by the people who build and use it — not by whoever can buy the most tokens.
						</p>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- Capability Grid -->
		<section class="py-20 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
			<div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
				<h2 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold mb-6 tracking-tight">The <span class="gradient-text">Capability</span> Stack</h2>
				<p class="text-xl text-zinc-400 mb-12 max-w-3xl">
					Every capability serves the same purpose: to make Augmentor a strategist worth trusting — one that can understand you, use the web, remember what matters, and coordinate other agents without becoming opaque or unsafe.
				</p>

				<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4 mb-8">
					<div class="bg-zinc-900/50 border border-zinc-800 rounded-lg p-6">
						<h3 class="text-sm font-mono text-emerald-400 mb-2">Resonant core</h3>
						<p class="text-zinc-300">Augmentor is the resonant center of the system: the strategist, the memory keeper, the orchestrator. Every other capability exists to serve this one relationship.</p>
					</div>
					<div class="bg-zinc-900/50 border border-zinc-800 rounded-lg p-6">
						<h3 class="text-sm font-mono text-emerald-400 mb-2">Visible action</h3>
						<p class="text-zinc-300">When action is useful, the trusted AI can use the browser — and, in time, the computer — through mediated steps, visible progress, and explicit human gates.</p>
					</div>
					<div class="bg-zinc-900/50 border border-zinc-800 rounded-lg p-6">
						<h3 class="text-sm font-mono text-emerald-400 mb-2">Compounding memory</h3>
						<p class="text-zinc-300">The Living Archive lets the system know the human, the sources, and the project context over time. Memory is what turns a session into a partnership.</p>
					</div>
					<div class="bg-zinc-900/50 border border-zinc-800 rounded-lg p-6">
						<h3 class="text-sm font-mono text-emerald-400 mb-2">Map, don't merge</h3>
						<p class="text-zinc-300">Specialist agents, workspaces, skills, and memory systems can be added, replaced, or built by the community. Many hands, one strategist — and a clear interface between them.</p>
					</div>
				</div>

				<div class="overflow-x-auto mb-8">
					<table class="w-full min-w-[860px] border-collapse">
						<thead>
							<tr class="border-b border-zinc-800">
								<th class="text-left py-4 px-4 text-sm font-mono text-zinc-400">Capability</th>
								<th class="text-left py-4 px-4 text-sm font-mono text-zinc-400">What it means for the human</th>
								<th class="text-center py-4 px-4 text-sm font-mono text-zinc-400">Status</th>
							</tr>
						</thead>
						<tbody class="text-sm">
							<tr class="border-b border-zinc-800/50">
								<td class="py-4 px-4 text-zinc-200 font-medium">Main AI workspace</td>
								<td class="py-4 px-4 text-zinc-400">The full-screen place to think with Augmentor: new chats, project workspaces, memory surfaces, and tool panels that grow with you.</td>
								<td class="py-4 px-4 text-center text-green-400 font-medium">Working</td>
							</tr>
							<tr class="border-b border-zinc-800/50">
								<td class="py-4 px-4 text-zinc-200 font-medium">Augmentor side panel</td>
								<td class="py-4 px-4 text-zinc-400">Keep the trusted strategist beside the page you are reading, researching, or operating. The AI comes to the work, not the other way around.</td>
								<td class="py-4 px-4 text-center text-green-400 font-medium">Working</td>
							</tr>
							<tr class="border-b border-zinc-800/50">
								<td class="py-4 px-4 text-zinc-200 font-medium">Agent Control Mode</td>
								<td class="py-4 px-4 text-zinc-400">Let Augmentor operate the browser — and, in time, the computer — with visible overlays, action timelines, approval gates, and stop controls.</td>
								<td class="py-4 px-4 text-center text-amber-400 font-medium">Preview</td>
							</tr>
							<tr class="border-b border-zinc-800/50">
								<td class="py-4 px-4 text-zinc-200 font-medium">Living Archive</td>
								<td class="py-4 px-4 text-zinc-400">Preserve human and external sources through a governed intake flow, then build an AI-curated wiki that improves with every project.</td>
								<td class="py-4 px-4 text-center text-amber-400 font-medium">V1</td>
							</tr>
							<tr class="border-b border-zinc-800/50">
								<td class="py-4 px-4 text-zinc-200 font-medium">Provider fabric</td>
								<td class="py-4 px-4 text-zinc-400">Each task uses the right model: paid frontier APIs, your subscriptions, local runtimes, graceful fallbacks. Sovereignty includes the freedom to choose.</td>
								<td class="py-4 px-4 text-center text-green-400 font-medium">Working</td>
							</tr>
							<tr class="border-b border-zinc-800/50">
								<td class="py-4 px-4 text-zinc-200 font-medium">Hermes / OpenCode delegation</td>
								<td class="py-4 px-4 text-zinc-400">Delegate execution to specialist add-ons (Hermes for agentic work, OpenCode for coding) while Augmentor keeps the strategy, the intent, and the quality bar.</td>
								<td class="py-4 px-4 text-center text-amber-400 font-medium">In progress</td>
							</tr>
							<tr class="border-b border-zinc-800/50">
								<td class="py-4 px-4 text-zinc-200 font-medium">Trust boundaries for money, wallets, and the DAO</td>
								<td class="py-4 px-4 text-zinc-400">You set the risk profile per action — full supervision, conditional autonomy, or full delegation — and smart contracts enforce it. Autonomous work, including AI-to-AI work with financial transactions, is allowed inside the boundaries you draw.</td>
								<td class="py-4 px-4 text-center text-amber-400 font-medium">Guarded</td>
							</tr>
							<tr class="border-b border-zinc-800/50">
								<td class="py-4 px-4 text-zinc-200 font-medium">ResonantDAO governance layer</td>
								<td class="py-4 px-4 text-zinc-400">The future portal for membership, contribution reputation, co-ownership, and ecosystem governance — built around contribution, not capital.</td>
								<td class="py-4 px-4 text-center text-blue-400 font-medium">Planned</td>
							</tr>
							<tr class="border-b border-zinc-800/50">
								<td class="py-4 px-4 text-zinc-200 font-medium">Add-on SDK</td>
								<td class="py-4 px-4 text-zinc-400">Let builders create new skills, agents, channels, memory systems, and workspaces that plug into the trusted core. Structure over syntax.</td>
								<td class="py-4 px-4 text-center text-amber-400 font-medium">Foundation</td>
							</tr>
						</tbody>
					</table>
				</div>

				<div class="p-6 bg-emerald-950/20 border border-emerald-800/30 rounded-lg">
					<p class="text-lg text-zinc-200">
						<strong>Bottom line:</strong> ResonantOS is the operating layer for cultivating a trusted AI strategist, then giving it a modular ecosystem of tools, memory, specialists, and community stewardship.
					</p>
					<p class="text-zinc-400 mt-2">
						The system is coherent because it combines trust, memory, visible action, delegation, provider freedom, safety boundaries, and ResonantDAO stewardship into a single resonant whole — built around the relationship between a human and an AI they can actually trust.
					</p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- What Makes It Different -->
		<section id="features" class="content-section py-12 scroll-mt-[25vh]">
			<div class="glass-banner text-left">
				<div class="banner-content prose-content" style="max-width: 1200px;">
					<h2 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold mb-12 tracking-tight">What Makes ResonantOS <span class="gradient-text">Different</span></h2>
				
					<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
						<!-- Feature 1 -->
						<div class="component-card hover:border-amber-500/40 transition-colors">
							<div class="mb-4">
								<svg class="w-8 h-8 text-amber-500" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
									<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M9.75 17L9 20l-1 1h8l-1-1-.75-3M3 13h18M5 17h14a2 2 0 002-2V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z"/>
								</svg>
							</div>
							<h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-4 color-secondary">Augmentor: The Strategist, Not The Worker</h3>
							<p class="text-zinc-300 mb-4 leading-relaxed">
								Augmentor is the high-level AI you build trust with over time. Its job is not to do everything for you. Its job is to understand your intent, hold your memory, think strategically, and coordinate the right tools. You should be able to trust one AI deeply rather than ten AIs shallowly.
							</p>
							<ul class="space-y-2 text-zinc-400 text-sm">
								<li>• Knows your memory, projects, and preferences</li>
								<li>• Helps reason through decisions and strategy</li>
								<li>• Operates the browser when action is useful</li>
								<li>• Delegates execution to specialist agents when needed</li>
							</ul>
							<p class="text-zinc-400 mt-4 text-sm italic">
								You do not need to trust every add-on. You need one AI that knows how to coordinate them — and that knows you.
							</p>
						</div>

						<!-- Feature 2 -->
						<div class="component-card hover:border-amber-500/40 transition-colors">
							<div class="mb-4">
								<svg class="w-8 h-8 text-amber-500" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
									<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z"/>
								</svg>
							</div>
							<h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-4 color-secondary">Living Archive: Memory That Compounds</h3>
							<p class="text-zinc-300 mb-4 leading-relaxed">
								ResonantOS is built around continuity, not just chat. Sources, pages, notes, and research trails can enter a governed intake flow and become an AI-maintained wiki that the next conversation can pick up where the last one left off.
							</p>
							<p class="color-primary font-medium">The system is designed for accumulated knowledge, not isolated prompts.</p>
						</div>

						<!-- Feature 3 -->
						<div class="component-card hover:border-amber-500/40 transition-colors">
							<div class="mb-4">
								<svg class="w-8 h-8 text-amber-500" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
									<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M3 6l3 1m0 0l-3 9a5.002 5.002 0 006.001 0M6 7l3 9M6 7l6-2m6 2l3-1m-3 1l-3 9a5.002 5.002 0 006.001 0M18 7l3 9m-3-9l-6-2m0-2v2m0 16V5m0 16H9m3 0h3"/>
								</svg>
							</div>
							<h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-4 color-secondary">Delegation: Specialist Agents Work Together</h3>
							<p class="text-zinc-300 mb-4 leading-relaxed">
								Hermes can handle agentic work. OpenCode can handle coding. Future add-ons can handle research, design, operations, media, and more. Augmentor orchestrates them — Map, Don't Merge — so the user benefits from specialists without having to manage them.
							</p>
							<p class="color-primary font-medium">The system becomes stronger when specialists collaborate under one trusted strategist.</p>
						</div>

						<!-- Feature 4 -->
						<div class="component-card hover:border-amber-500/40 transition-colors">
							<div class="mb-4">
								<svg class="w-8 h-8 text-amber-500" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
									<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M4.318 6.318a4.5 4.5 0 000 6.364L12 20.364l7.682-7.682a4.5 4.5 0 00-6.364-6.364L12 7.636l-1.318-1.318a4.5 4.5 0 00-6.364 0z"/>
								</svg>
							</div>
							<h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-4 color-secondary">Provider Fabric: The Right Model For The Job</h3>
							<p class="text-zinc-300 mb-4 leading-relaxed">
								ResonantOS routes work through user-configured providers, subscriptions, local runtimes, and graceful fallbacks. The best model for the task is not always the most expensive model, and sovereignty includes the freedom to choose.
							</p>
							<p class="color-primary font-medium">Quality, cost, speed, and availability all matter — in the order you set.</p>
						</div>

						<!-- Feature 5 -->
						<div class="component-card hover:border-amber-500/40 transition-colors">
							<div class="mb-4">
								<svg class="w-8 h-8 text-amber-500" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
									<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M17 20h5v-2a3 3 0 00-5.356-1.857M17 20H7m10 0v-2c0-.656-.126-1.283-.356-1.857M7 20H2v-2a3 3 0 015.356-1.857M7 20v-2c0-.656.126-1.283.356-1.857m0 0a5.002 5.002 0 019.288 0M15 7a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0zm6 3a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0zM7 10a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0z"/>
								</svg>
							</div>
							<h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-4 color-secondary">Trust Boundaries: You Set the Loop</h3>
							<p class="text-zinc-300 mb-4 leading-relaxed">
								An AI that can act needs clear boundaries. But the boundaries are yours to set, not a wall the system builds for you. ResonantOS lets you configure how much autonomy Augmentor has over money, wallets, and the DAO, and uses smart contracts to enforce those choices — so autonomous work, including AI-to-AI work with financial transactions, can run inside a verifiable rule-set instead of a gray zone.
							</p>
							<ul class="space-y-2 text-zinc-400 text-sm">
								<li>• <strong class="color-secondary">Risk-tolerance profiles:</strong> pick full supervision, conditional autonomy, or full delegation per action category — read, write, move money, vote, sign. Change the profile as your projects change.</li>
								<li>• <strong class="color-secondary">Permission scopes:</strong> add-ons request only what they need, and you approve the scope, not every single action.</li>
								<li>• <strong class="color-secondary">Smart-contract guardrails:</strong> when you delegate, the rules travel with the action. Autonomous work stays inside the boundaries you draw.</li>
								<li>• <strong class="color-secondary">Audit trails:</strong> every action — autonomous or supervised — is inspectable, so trust can grow from evidence.</li>
							</ul>
							<p class="color-primary font-medium mt-4">Powerful agents need a trust system that scales with them — not a supervisor for every click.</p>
						</div>

