								</svg>
							</div>
							<h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-4 color-secondary">Browser Portal: Work Where The Web Lives</h3>
							<p class="text-zinc-300 mb-4 leading-relaxed">
								Research, tools, DAOs, wallets, dashboards, documents, and apps already live in the browser. ResonantOS turns the browser into the portal where Augmentor and the modular ecosystem actually meet the work — not a separate chat window you have to copy things into.
							</p>
							<p class="color-primary font-medium">The browser becomes the place where trusted AI work happens.</p>
						</div>

						<!-- Feature 7 -->
						<div class="component-card hover:border-amber-500/40 transition-colors">
