								</svg>
							</div>
							<h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-4 color-secondary">Add-ons: Build On Top Of The Core</h3>
							<p class="text-zinc-300 mb-4 leading-relaxed">
								The ecosystem is modular by design. Builders can create new agents, tools, channels, dashboards, memory systems, and workflows that plug into the trusted core. The interface is open. We value structure over syntax.
							</p>
