				<div class="space-y-6">
					<!-- FAQ Item 1 -->
					<details class="bg-zinc-900/50 border border-zinc-800 rounded-lg p-6 hover:border-zinc-700 transition-colors group">
						<summary class="text-xl font-semibold text-zinc-100 cursor-pointer flex items-center justify-between">
							<span>What will this cost me?</span>
							<span class="text-zinc-600 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform">▼</span>
						</summary>
						<p class="mt-4 text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed">
							ResonantOS is designed to route through providers and local runtimes that you choose. The product makes cost, fallback, subscription, and model quality visible instead of forcing one default model for every task. You pay for the models you actually use. The operating layer is free.
						</p>
					</details>

					<!-- FAQ Item 2 -->
					<details class="bg-zinc-900/50 border border-zinc-800 rounded-lg p-6 hover:border-zinc-700 transition-colors group">
						<summary class="text-xl font-semibold text-zinc-100 cursor-pointer flex items-center justify-between">
