						</summary>
						<p class="mt-4 text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed">
							ResonantDAO is the stewardship layer around the product: membership, the licence, contribution reputation, and governance. It is being built in parallel with the app — slowly, on purpose, so the culture and the rules can grow together. The product is the work; the DAO is the promise that the work will stay aligned with the people who use it.
						</p>
					</details>

					<!-- FAQ Item 7 -->
					<details class="bg-zinc-900/50 border border-zinc-800 rounded-lg p-6 hover:border-zinc-700 transition-colors group">
						<summary class="text-xl font-semibold text-zinc-100 cursor-pointer flex items-center justify-between">
